{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Unforeseen Resurrection - Otome Isekai RPG",
    "steam_appid": 2206860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Alpha Demo Feedback Form]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi! ^-^ If you would like to leave a feedback for the prototype's alpha demo, the form is my website link on here! Alternatively, you could also just go to inunekonanita(dot)com</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[WORK IN PROGRESS]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game and demo are in active development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The screenshots show the current state of the features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things are still subject to change, i.e. features can be added, removed, changed, etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[STORY]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Betrayed. Murdered. Rewound. Every painful death offers a chance to go back in time and rewrite your fate, but every rewind chips away at the lifeline that keeps your parents alive - your scholarship allowance. Each rewind comes with two gut-wrenching consequences: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hold onto your memories but say goodbye to your coins, or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lacking in coins, face a blank slate with aching void yearning for a lost love, and clues swallowed by the sands of time (game over).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is your enemy, your scholarship allowance your currency, and your heart the ultimate prize. Navigate a world where every path whispers promises and demands sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Seek vengeance for your betrayal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Protect your parents from a fate worse than death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Find true love in a web of deceit and shifting loyalties?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But each rewind resets your relationships. Every death is a gamble. Can you rewrite your fate before your coins run out and your heart pays the ultimate price?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned but Unconfirmed Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiplayer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3D Map Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dress Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dating Sim / Life Sim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hack and Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose Your Own Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Female Protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Character Customization (with limits)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Windows: This is the initial platform during the development</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Alpha Demo Feedback Form]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi! ^-^ If you would like to leave a feedback for the prototype's alpha demo, the form is my website link on here! Alternatively, you could also just go to inunekonanita(dot)com</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[WORK IN PROGRESS]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game and demo are in active development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The screenshots show the current state of the features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things are still subject to change, i.e. features can be added, removed, changed, etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[STORY]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Betrayed. Murdered. Rewound. Every painful death offers a chance to go back in time and rewrite your fate, but every rewind chips away at the lifeline that keeps your parents alive - your scholarship allowance. Each rewind comes with two gut-wrenching consequences: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hold onto your memories but say goodbye to your coins, or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lacking in coins, face a blank slate with aching void yearning for a lost love, and clues swallowed by the sands of time (game over).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is your enemy, your scholarship allowance your currency, and your heart the ultimate prize. Navigate a world where every path whispers promises and demands sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Seek vengeance for your betrayal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Protect your parents from a fate worse than death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Find true love in a web of deceit and shifting loyalties?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But each rewind resets your relationships. Every death is a gamble. Can you rewrite your fate before your coins run out and your heart pays the ultimate price?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned but Unconfirmed Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiplayer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3D Map Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dress Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dating Sim / Life Sim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hack and Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose Your Own Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Female Protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Character Customization (with limits)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Windows: This is the initial platform during the development</p>",
    "short_description": "A 3D open-world farming RPG with life-sim elements and otome isekai themes. It is set in a fantastical modern world, where computer games bleed into reality and digitized beasts lurk, you wield a unique power: time travel with a hefty price tag.",
